[1m[38;5;231mHow should the caller specify the destination and format?[0m

[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mExplicit --out + --format (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mBoth stated on the command line. No inference rules; the crontab line is self-documenting.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m Infer format from extension
     [38;5;246m`--out report.csv` implies CSV; `--format` overrides. Shorter, needs rules for odd extensions.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m --out-dir, derived filename
     [38;5;246mreportkit names the file `billing-<day>.<ext>`. Consistent naming, less path control.[39m
